# E11c -- Clean hostility-lever test. Same pairing as E11b (small prey first, cougar/dingo/wolf piggy-backed on) but the whole surface is released at every cycle so the gate can never stay shut, predators are gathered beside prey AND the lever is reapplied every 1,500 ticks so every predator that ever arrives gets it. Arms: no lever, OPPOSED_TO_LIFE, CRAZED, rel_map PREDATOR_OR_PREY; 3 replicates each; 15,000 ticks after the predators open.
