## Predictions (written before the run)
- proximity is the whole story: all four arms kill at similar rates; rel reads PREDATOR_OR_PREY/DANGEROUS_ANIMAL in every arm
- levers raise aggression: crazed and/or opposed arms kill more, faster, or attack prey the no-lever arm ignores (emus)
- the cache write is inert: relmap arm matches the no-lever arm and DF overwrites the written value by the next rel read

